#!/usr/bin/python3 -IB
"""Workspace transfer entry (run as root on the host, never inside a cell; validation.md A-07–A-10, A-12):
python3 -I -B bin/engine-workspace --root ROOT push|export WORKSPACE ...
Of the client it loads only client/link.py and client/workspace.py, the part that is TCB (README TCB 模块清单, K-41)."""
